# ZL Loudness Match for WebCLAP

ZLLMatch by ZL Audio (zsliu98), a loudness matching plugin, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official ZL Audio
release.

- ZLLMatch: https://github.com/ZL-Audio/ZLLMatch (commit 0a567f8, version 0.2.2)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-zl-lmatch.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/zl-lmatch-webclap.patch`): the processor builds without its editor, and a block
without a transport has no position. The Aux (sidechain) input is a second input port; with Side: Aux, Learn
matches to what the host feeds it. The plugin has no window: openDAW's device panel (`ui/panel.html`) is all of it.

